<mxCell id="d5c79" value="N/2, N/10 and 3N all grow in a straight line with N. Big O keeps the &lt;b&gt;shape&lt;/b&gt; of the growth and drops the multiplier: ½·N → &lt;b&gt;O(N)&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="348" width="400" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
